{"suttaId":"an4.120","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-iv","vriCode":"s0402m3.mul","paras":[1084,1088],"vripara":"120"},"segments":{"an4.120:0.3":"Dutiyabhayasuttaṃ","an4.120:1.1":"“Cattārimāni, bhikkhave, bhayāni.","an4.120:1.2":"Katamāni cattāri?","an4.120:1.3":"Aggibhayaṃ, udakabhayaṃ, rājabhayaṃ, corabhayaṃ – imāni kho, bhikkhave, cattāri bhayānī”ti.","an4.120:1.5":"Dasamaṃ.","an4.120:1.6":"Kesivaggo dutiyo.","an4.120:2.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","an4.120:2.1":"Kesi javo patodo ca, nāgo ṭhānena pañcamaṃ;","an4.120:2.3":"Appamādo ca ārakkho, saṃvejanīyañca dve bhayāti."},"attha":{"book":"Mp-iv","bookName":"Catukkanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0402a.att","from":1401,"to":1404,"paras":[{"para":1401,"vripara":"118-120","refs":["an4.120:1"],"lines":["118-120. Aṭṭhame <b>dassanīyānī</b>ti passitabbayuttakāni.","<b>Saṃvejanīyānī</b>ti saṃvegajanakāni.","Navame <b>jātibhayan</b>ti jātiṃ ārabbha uppajjanakabhayaṃ.","Sesapadesupi eseva nayo.","Dasame <b>aggibhayan</b>ti aggiṃ paṭicca uppajjanakabhayaṃ.","Sesapadesupi eseva nayo."],"lineRefs":[["an4.120:1"],["an4.120:1"],["an4.120:1"],["an4.120:1"],["an4.120:1"],["an4.120:1"]]},{"para":1402,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kesivaggo dutiyo."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1403,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["(13)3. Bhayavaggo"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1404,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.120:1"],"lines":["Attānuvādasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an4.120:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-iv","bookName":"Catukkanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0402t.tik","from":1581,"to":1585,"paras":[{"para":1581,"vripara":"118-120","refs":["an4.120:1"],"lines":["118-120. Aṭṭhame <b>saddhassā</b>ti buddhādīsu pasannacittassa vattasampannassa, yassa pāto vuṭṭhāya cetiyaṅgaṇavattādīni sabbavattāni katāneva paññāyanti.","<b>Dassanīyānī</b>ti dassanārahāni.","<b>Saṃvego</b> nāma sahottappaṃ ñāṇaṃ.","Abhijātiṭṭhānādīnipi tassa uppattihetūni bhavantīti sikkhāpento āha <b>“saṃvegajanakānī”</b>ti.","<b>Ṭhānānī</b>ti kāraṇāni, padesaṭṭhānāni vā.","Navamadasamāni suviññeyyāni."],"lineRefs":[["an4.120:1"],["an4.120:1"],["an4.120:1"],["an4.120:1"],["an4.120:1"],["an4.120:1"]]},{"para":1582,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Saṃvejanīyasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1583,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kesivaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1584,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["(13)3. Bhayavaggo"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1585,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.120:1"],"lines":["Attānuvādasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an4.120:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
